00:00:05.072 --> 00:00:09.777 size:53% position:73% line:53%
assez basses; assez envahissant

00:00:06.874 --> 00:00:12.947 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour quelqu'un qui est mon

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:13.547 size:53% position:73% line:53%
