00:00:26.827 --> 00:00:29.863 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ça allait comme un peu

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:30.464 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en gradation, en augmentant.

00:00:29.063 --> 00:00:33.334 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'était de plus en plus

00:00:30.364 --> 00:00:34.201 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ant, de plus en plus

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:35.736 size:53% position:73% line:53%
intense.

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:37.004 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Massage des épaules,

00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:38.205 size:53% position:73% line:53%
