00:02:43.063 --> 00:02:49.403 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comme agente de pastorale.

00:02:48.268 --> 00:02:50.237 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Elle a situation

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:52.306 size:53% position:73% line:53%
