00:03:00.314 --> 00:03:05.586 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"C'est l Ouellet."

00:03:04.284 --> 00:03:06.420 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La plainte envers le cardinal

00:03:05.085 --> 00:03:07.254 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ouellet se rend directement

00:03:05.919 --> 00:03:10.157 size:53% position:73% line:53%
