00:03:11.925 --> 00:03:16.296 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Un an plus tard, lte

00:03:13.627 --> 00:03:19.166 size:53% position:73% line:53%
attend toujours ses conclusions.

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:20.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Le diocèse de Québec dit

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:22.202 size:53% position:73% line:53%
